      "ArrowUp: increase by one step",
      "ArrowDown: decrease by one step",
      "Enter: commit the current value",
      "Tab: enter/leave the component",
      "Backspace/Delete: edit the digits"
    ],
    "motion": {
      "duration": "0.1s~0.2s",
      "easing": "standard",
      "description": "步进数值更新即时无动画；按钮按下有轻微缩放反馈"
    },
    "behaviorNotes": "min/max 钳制输入值，到达边界时对应步进按钮禁用变灰（--color-text-4）；precision 控制小数位；失焦自动归一化非法输入"
